# Staged OCR model artifacts.
#
# `model.onnx` is 76 MB and would dominate the repository and its history for the life of
# the project. Stage it with `tools/fetch_ocr_assets.ps1` (or `tools/fetch_ocr_assets.py`),
# which downloads the pinned upstream revision and verifies every artifact against the
# tracked `resources/ocr/ppocrv6/manifest.json` before installing it.
#
# `manifest.json` itself stays tracked deliberately: it holds the reviewed SHA-256 values,
# and ignoring it would leave nothing to verify a download against.
resources/ocr/ppocrv6/model.onnx
resources/ocr/ppocrv6/inference.yml
resources/ocr/ppocrv6/dictionary.txt
